*OLD RATES - NEW RATES EFFECTIVE 2008 LISTED BELOW   LRATE = 3.79               
   LRATE = 4.54                                                                 
END-IF                                                                          
IF AGE = 65, 66, 67, 68, 69                                                     
*OLD RATES - NEW RATES EFFECTIVE 2007 LISTED BELOW   LRATE = 5.40               
*OLD RATES - NEW RATES EFFECTIVE 2008 LISTED BELOW   LRATE = 5.05               
