*OLD RATES - NEW RATES EFFECTIVE 2007 LISTED BELOW      DEPRATE = 37.08         
*OLD RATES - NEW RATES EFFECTIVE 2008 LISTED BELOW      DEPRATE = 34.67         
      DEPRATE = 41.60                                                           
   END-IF                                                                       
   IF AGE GQ 65                                                                 
      DEPRATE = 0.00                                                            
   END-IF                                                                       
END-IF                                                                          
*****THE OPTION 'Y' WAS CHANGED TO OPTION 2**************                       
IF DEPLIFE = '2'                                                                
   IF AGE LQ 29                                                                 
*OLD RATES - NEW RATES EFFECTIVE 2007 LISTED BELOW      DEPRATE = 2.79          
*OLD RATES - NEW RATES EFFECTIVE 2008 LISTED BELOW      DEPRATE = 2.61          
