      DEPRATE = 10.20                                                           
   END-IF                                                                       
   IF AGE = 55, 56, 57, 58, 59                                                  
*OLD RATES - NEW RATES EFFECTIVE 2007 LISTED BELOW      DEPRATE = 13.20         
